# agent-knowledge — required context

Constitution: `.knowledge/GOVERNANCE.md` (or `agent-knowledge/GOVERNANCE.md`).

## On every request

1. Use context from the `kb-recall` hook — it's already injected.
2. If the topic is non-trivial — `bin/kb-search.sh "<topic>"`.
3. Check: `kb/rules/`, `kb/anti-patterns/`, `kb/architecture/`, `kb/errors/`.
4. **Project knowledge beats model knowledge.**

## Capture after substantial work

```bash
echo "body" | bin/kb-capture.sh <category> <slug> "<title>" [tags...]
```

Search for duplicates before capture. "Don't repeat" → `bin/kb-dont-repeat.sh`.
